commit 0170df28d5560a91ec692d120c203e480e238751
tests/shell: an interrupted ndt serve gate never ends on rc=0

The main gate, the page gate, the rebuild gate and the ndt --measuring gate
printed rc=0 from their EXIT trap when stopped with SIGTERM, which reads as a
pass; the rebuild gate's line went into ci.log instead. Each now traps TERM,
