commit a6d443c01616247c0c13b4c456aea96b981d863f
ndt serve page: probe /measuring while a measurement runs

The probe that runs once a minute during a measuring pause now reads
/measuring (ndt status --measuring) instead of /lab, so it no longer runs
sudo or asks the kernel for its graph. It leaves the tabs alone: the last
full read keeps its time, and the top bar shows when it last probed. The
README and the manual give the measured cost of both reads; the bundle is
rebuilt.


