commit c4247ca25596b4d0fec67d9e2077868a97b3b70f
ndt status --measuring, and ndt serve's /measuring read

ndt status gains a --measuring mode that prints only the declared and
measuring rows. Both plain status and the new mode now call one function,
status_measuring_rows, so they cannot disagree; it reads the claim file and
the process table and nothing else. ndt serve answers GET /measuring from it
with /lab's reading of the rows. The rc and lock-probe line citations move
with the 23 lines added above them.


