+# a measurement pauses its refresh (Adam, 2026-10-01: the probe reads only the claim's measuring=
+# and the process table -- no sudo, no request to the kernel, no OVS or bmv2 query). Everything it
+# calls reads a file or `ps`: measuring_declared, in_flight, mn_count. Keep it that way -- a sudo, a
