+        # outlive the fabric it was driving -- a client whose control channel never completes
+        # just sits there, and one was found still running 32 hours after its fabric was torn
+        # down (review session, 2026-08-23). Reporting that as "measuring" tells every reader,
+        # human and cross-session, that the lab is busy when it is merely dirty, and the
